    "reading_order": 21,
    "text": "Using our previous notation we can say: If p, then q. We can also say ‘p implies\nq’, and denote it by p  q.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
    "document_id": "NCERT_X_MATH_JEMH1A1",
    "page": 14,
    "block_id": "jemh1a1_p014_b22",
    "type": "paragraph",
